before	<col=000080>Requirements:</col>
req	Druidic Ritual
req	Troll Stronghold
req	Death Plateau
req	Level 31 Herblore
step	1	10	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Sanfew</col> in <col=800000>Taverley</col> needs <col=800000>Goutweed</col> to cure a troll-made sickness, and only the trolls grow it. His friend <col=800000>Eadgar</col>, whom I freed from the troll prison, lives in a cave at the top of <col=800000>Trollheim</col>. I should ask <col=800000>Eadgar</col> for help; the trolls' cook, <col=800000>Burntmeat</col>, keeps the goutweed in the <col=800000>Troll Stronghold</col>.</col>
step	2	20	After speaking to Burntmeat
line	<str>Sanfew in Taverley needs Goutweed to cure a troll-made sickness, and only the trolls grow it. His friend Eadgar, whom I freed from the troll prison, lives in a cave at the top of Trollheim.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Burntmeat</col> in the <col=800000>Troll Stronghold</col> kitchen. He wants a tasty human for his stew. I should tell <col=800000>Eadgar</col>.</col>
step	3	30	After hearing Eadgar's plan
line	<str>Sanfew in Taverley needs Goutweed to cure a troll-made sickness, and only the trolls grow it. His friend Eadgar, whom I freed from the troll prison, lives in a cave at the top of Trollheim.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Burntmeat in the Troll Stronghold kitchen. He wants a tasty human for his stew.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Eadgar</col> has a plan to fool <col=800000>Burntmeat</col>, and the first thing he needs is a parrot. <col=800000>Parroty Pete</col> at <col=800000>Ardougne Zoo</col> might know how to catch one.</col>
step	4	40	After bringing Eadgar the parrot
line	<str>Sanfew in Taverley needs Goutweed to cure a troll-made sickness, and only the trolls grow it. His friend Eadgar, whom I freed from the troll prison, lives in a cave at the top of Trollheim.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Burntmeat in the Troll Stronghold kitchen. He wants a tasty human for his stew.</str>
line	<str>Eadgar has a plan to fool Burntmeat, and the first thing he needs is a parrot.</str>
line	<col=000080>I caught a drunk parrot with <col=800000>Alco-chunks</col> and brought it to <col=800000>Eadgar</col>. He plans to build a fake man: he needs <col=800000>Logs</col>, 10 <col=800000>Grain</col>, 5 <col=800000>Raw chickens</col> and some dirty clothes, and the parrot must learn to talk like a human. I should hide the parrot somewhere in the troll prison where it will hear people talking.</col>
step	5	50	After hiding the parrot
line	<str>Sanfew in Taverley needs Goutweed to cure a troll-made sickness, and only the trolls grow it. His friend Eadgar, whom I freed from the troll prison, lives in a cave at the top of Trollheim.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Burntmeat in the Troll Stronghold kitchen. He wants a tasty human for his stew.</str>
line	<str>Eadgar has a plan to fool Burntmeat, and the first thing he needs is a parrot.</str>
line	<str>I caught a drunk parrot with Alco-chunks and brought it to Eadgar. He plans to build a fake man: he needs Logs, 10 Grain, 5 Raw chickens and some dirty clothes, and the parrot must learn to talk like a human.</str>
line	<col=000080>I hid the parrot under the torture rack in the troll prison. Now I should gather the supplies for <col=800000>Eadgar</col>. <col=800000>Sanfew</col> says <col=800000>Tegid</col> at the laundry might part with some dirty robes.</col>
step	6	60	After handing over the supplies
line	<str>Sanfew in Taverley needs Goutweed to cure a troll-made sickness, and only the trolls grow it. His friend Eadgar, whom I freed from the troll prison, lives in a cave at the top of Trollheim.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to Burntmeat in the Troll Stronghold kitchen. He wants a tasty human for his stew.</str>
line	<str>Eadgar has a plan to fool Burntmeat, and the first thing he needs is a parrot.</str>
line	<str>I caught a drunk parrot with Alco-chunks and brought it to Eadgar. He plans to build a fake man: he needs Logs, 10 Grain, 5 Raw chickens and some dirty clothes, and the parrot must learn to talk like a human.</str>
line	<str>I hid the parrot under the torture rack in the troll prison.</str>
line	<col=000080>I gave <col=800000>Eadgar</col> everything he needed for the fake man. He now wants a truth potion to use on the trolls. I should dry a <col=800000>Troll thistle</col> from <col=800000>Trollheim</col>, grind it, and add it to a <col=800000>Ranarr potion (unf)</col>.</col>
step	7	70	After giving Eadgar the potion
